### ② Authorization request — opened in the SYSTEM BROWSER (front channel)
GET /authorize?response_type=code
    &client_id=murmur-ios
    &redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fapp.murmur.example%2Foauth%2Fcallback
    &scope=openid%20messages%3Asend%20messages%3Aread%20contacts%3Aread
    &state=5f1c9e4b2a7d4e0f9a3c6b8d1e2f4a7c                  ← random; checked at ⑥
    &code_challenge=E9Melhoa2OwvFrEMTJguCHaoeK1t8URWbuGJSstw-cM ← PKCE (Chapter 11)
    &code_challenge_method=S256 HTTP/1.1
Host: auth.murmur.example

### ④ After login: AS redirects the browser back to the app (front channel)
HTTP/1.1 302 Found
Location: https://app.murmur.example/oauth/callback
    ?code=SplxlOBeZQQYbYS6WxSbIA                   ← short-lived, single-use
    &state=5f1c9e4b2a7d4e0f9a3c6b8d1e2f4a7c         ← must equal what the app sent
    &iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.murmur.example          ← which AS answered (RFC 9207, Chapter 11)
Cache-Control: no-store

### ⑦ Token request — app → AS directly (back channel, TLS)
POST /token HTTP/1.1
Host: auth.murmur.example
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code
&code=SplxlOBeZQQYbYS6WxSbIA
&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fapp.murmur.example%2Foauth%2Fcallback   ← must match ②
&client_id=murmur-ios                                                ← public client: no secret
&code_verifier=dBjftJeZ4CVP-mB92K27uhbUJU1p1r_wW1gFWFOEjXk          ← PKCE (Chapter 11)

### ⑧ Token response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
Cache-Control: no-store                             ← tokens must never be cached

{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6ImF0K2p3dCIsImtpZCI6IjIwMjYtMTEtYSJ9.eyJpc3Mi…",
  "token_type": "Bearer",                           ← "DPoP" once sender-constrained (Chapter 13)
  "expires_in": 300,                                ← 5 minutes (Chapter 15)
  "refresh_token": "8xLOxBtZp8…",                   ← long-lived; rotated on use (Chapter 13)
  "scope": "openid messages:send messages:read contacts:read"
}

### ⑨ API call
POST /v1/messages HTTP/1.1
Host: api.murmur.example
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6ImF0K2p3dCIsImtpZCI6IjIwMjYtMTEtYSJ9.eyJpc3Mi…
